[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Center Game"]
[Variation "Danish Gambit Declined: Queen grabs d4"]
[ECO "C21"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "high"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "trap,pawn-grab"]
[For "black"]
[Kind "against-us"]
[Opponent "9.Bxf3"]
[Start "1. e4 e5 2. d4 exd4 3. c3 d5 4. exd5 Qxd5 5. cxd4 Nc6 6. Nf3 Bb4+ 7. Nc3 Bg4 8. Be2 Bxf3 9. Bxf3"]

9... Qxd4 $4 { Grabs a pawn, but the queen is defended only by the knight. } 10. Bxc6+ { Takes the knight with check. Black has to recapture, and that removes the only defender of the queen. } 10... bxc6 11. Qxd4 *
